#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""gel — command-line frontend for the GEL execution engine.

Linux-style: ``gel <noun> <verb> [flags]``. Run ``gel help`` for the full
command tree, or ``gel <subcommand> --help`` for any single command.

This is the local-mode CLI. A separate ``gelctl`` (next iteration) wraps
the same commands in ssh for remote (AWS) operation. The two binaries
share argument names so muscle memory transfers.

Layout assumed:
    capstone/
      ├── GEL/          (this repo — engine + this CLI)
      └── connector/    (sibling — SDK + admin web app)
"""
